    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0001",
      "source": "The value corresponding to this key is an NSString that’s the localized skip label if a localizedStringsBundle is set on the AVPlayerInterstitialEventController and a skipControlLocalizedLabelBundleKey on the AVPlayerInterstitialEvent whose skippable event state changed.",
      "ko": "이 키에 대응하는 값은 `NSString`이며, `AVPlayerInterstitialEventController`에 `localizedStringsBundle`이 설정되어 있고 건너뛰기 이벤트 상태가 변경된 `AVPlayerInterstitialEvent`에 `skipControlLocalizedLabelBundleKey`가 있는 경우 지역화된 skip label입니다.",
      "sourceHash": "b5f33eabe75e47a5f153a7c4c52f4e1c7ff5ccdc3fd0f364905ba8ff0e667708",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0002",
      "source": "Note that this key will not be present if there is no localizedStringsBundle set, or if the currentEventSkippableState changed to AVPlayerInterstitialEventSkippableEventStateNotSkippable.",
      "ko": "`localizedStringsBundle`이 설정되지 않았거나 현재 이벤트의 skippable 상태가 `AVPlayerInterstitialEventSkippableEventStateNotSkippable`로 변경된 경우 이 키는 존재하지 않습니다.",
      "sourceHash": "99fad4e017564af1c0186fd89afbd95639c6124c4f6fa4fadf45035fbde8cb64",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
